    <h1>Vision and Priorities</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Beyond its administrative duties, the IMX Steering Committee works towards a long-term vision for the
      conference and its community.
    </p>
    <p class="note">
      <strong>Draft in preparation.</strong> The Steering Committee's vision and strategic priorities will be
      published here.
    </p>

    <h2>Vision</h2>
    <p class="note">To follow.</p>

    <h2>Strategic priorities</h2>
    <p class="note">To follow.</p>

    <p>
      Interested in helping to shape these priorities? Find out how to
      <a href={url('join/')}>join the Steering Committee</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
